Goblins tribal aggro: explode with Goblin Lackey (put fatties into play) and Aether Vial, chain card advantage via Goblin Ringleader and Goblin Matron tutors, and buff the team with Goblin Warchief/Chieftain. Krenko, Mob Boss goes wide fast. Wasteland + Rishadan Port deny mana while you beat down. Cavern of Souls makes them uncounterable. Curve out, refill with Ringleader, and swarm.
